// CROWN — a self-recursive function installs an absorbing handler around its own
// recursive call, so the parameter reaches the frame by an unmasked
// path and by a masked cycle. Expect E_EffectMismatch.
//
// Refused through the pinned boot (measured 2026-09-23). A guard: the
// masked cycle must terminate — a path holds each effect once, its
// first hit.
effect E { op() -> Int }
handler absorb { op() => resume(5) }
fn walk(f, n) = if n == 0 { f() } else { (walk(f, n - 1)) ~> absorb }
fn bad() with !E = walk(() => op(), 0)
handler eh { op() => resume(7) }
fn main() = (bad()) ~> eh
